              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of તપાસવું (tapāsvũ) is not settled. EtymDB links it to an Arabic verb for examining and lists Marathi tapāsṇe beside it, but CDIAL has no entry for it, so the Arabic link is unconfirmed (EtymDB)."
