          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઓળખપત્ર (oḷakhpatra) is built from oḷakh, \"identity, recognition\", and patra, \"leaf, letter\". CDIAL lists the verb oḷakhvũ, \"to know, distinguish\", under Sanskrit upalakṣayati, \"beholds\" (CDIAL 2226), and patra is Sanskrit páttra, \"leaf\" (CDIAL 7733)."
