            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "દુકાન રવિવારે બંધ છે. — dukān ravivāre bandh che — \"The shop is closed on Sundays.\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બંધ (bandh) is Sanskrit bandhá, \"bond, damming, custody\", taken over whole, a tatsama; CDIAL lists its inherited cousin bā̃dh, \"dam\" (CDIAL 9136). CDIAL does not give the sense \"shut\", which also matches Persian band, and the two words may have run together."
            }
          ]
        },
