            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બેંક સવારે ખૂલે છે. — bẽk savāre khūle che — \"The bank opens in the morning.\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ખોલવું opens a thing; ખૂલવું (khūlvũ) is the thing opening."
